Step 1: Login to the OLT 0C through  console cable
sw to config mode
Step 2: Insert 10G SFP module in the port 0/3/1 and port 0/4/1
Step 3: Set the port that will be used on the OLT 0C
as the uplink of 0D to cascade. use the following commands:

Interface mpu 0/3
network-role 1 cascade 
quit

Interface mpu 0/4
network-role 1 cascade 
quit

Step 4: add the vlans of 0D to the cascaded ports 
and the uplink port, using the following commands.

the vlans of 0D are:
"FTTH SIP voice" 2814  smart
"FTTH internet"  2714  smart
"Management"     2000  standaard

vlan 2714 smart
vlan 2814 smart

(vlan desc 2000 description "Management")
vlan desc 2714 description "FTTH Internet"
vlan desc 2814 description "FTTH SIP voice"

 port vlan 2000 0/3 1
 port vlan 2714 0/3 1
 port vlan 2814 0/3 1

link-aggregation 0/3 1 egress-ingress workmode lacp-static 
link-aggregation add-member 0/3/1 0/4 1

Step 5: Add the Vlans of 0D to the uplinkport 
of 0C using the following commands.

 port vlan 2000 0/3 0
 port vlan 2714 0/3 0
 port vlan 2814  0/3 0

